      "notes": "Table 2 (not an eligible owner occupier) used as the general non-concessional rate; the eligible owner-occupier concession (Table 1, lower rates up to $1,455,000) is NOT modelled at P0. Top band is a flat $4.54 per $100 of the TOTAL value. Numerically identical to statutory determination DI2026-155 (archived act-di2026-155-amounts-payable-duty-determination-2026.2026-08-21.pdf, sha256 bcdc3a771a7b8be15e10335d9cd26702f9a25eb92d8f4537066a1a838c02a0e8), commencing 1 July 2026. Internal continuity exact on all marginal rows."
    }
